Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.37,0:00:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.91,0:00:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.53,0:00:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.91,0:01:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that hat was empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.31,0:01:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.45,0:01:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.95,0:01:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll beat that, Baker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.65,0:01:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Your guess was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.93,0:01:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess wrong again, and it will cost you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.97,0:01:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There are still three magical\Nhats left on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.11,0:01:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and one of them holds a\Nspecial surprise just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.59,0:01:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If you destroy the hat that hides my\Ndark magician, you'll win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.05,0:01:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose the empty one,\Nand it's my turn again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.89,0:01:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm betting you'll pick the hat that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,conceals the trap card\NI just put into play.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.55,0:01:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A trap card?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.99,0:01:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, which hat will it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.33,0:01:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're taking a big gamble, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.61,0:01:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If he guesses right, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.95,0:01:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-Eyes White Dragon,\Nattack the middle hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.81,0:02:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now you've done it.\NActivated my trap card, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.73,0:02:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Spellbinding Circle
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.27,0:02:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,A Blue-Eyes White Dragon is\Nnormally unstoppable, but
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.27,0:02:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,once drained of its energy\Nby the spell-binding circle,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.95,0:02:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,it's no match for the full\Npower of my Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.17,0:02:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And that puts an end to\Nyour blue-eyes white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.41,0:02:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.15,0:03:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.35,0:03:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And that puts an end to your dark magician\NThere are only three blue-eyes white
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.95,0:03:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,dragon cards in the world And they're all\Nin my deck Your grandpa had the fourth,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.87,0:03:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but I ripped it up But how could I possibly\Nknow that if I'm not really Seto Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.59,0:03:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.50,0:03:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe it\Nwhen you beat all three
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.27,0:03:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,of my Blue Eyes White Dragons with Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.17,0:03:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, without that\Nmonster in your deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.03,0:03:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,there's absolutely no way\Nyou can win your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.01,0:03:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone heard about your duel with Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.43,0:03:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how this loser knows about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.69,0:03:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not my brother, Yugi. I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.91,0:03:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I am now rerouting the data from\NField 146 at the Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.59,0:03:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, we'll be able to confirm\Nif Yugi Moto is dueling there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.87,0:03:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.33,0:03:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now show me what you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.07,0:04:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes. We're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.43,0:04:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now downloading duel data.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.51,0:04:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.83,0:04:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi Moto is in this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.65,0:04:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you show it to me on screen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.43,0:04:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.51,0:04:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I think the part you'll find most\Ninteresting is the name of Yugi's opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.27,0:04:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.18,0:04:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this your idea of a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.91,0:04:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I never joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.55,0:04:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensors indicate that the opponent\Nopposite Yugi is registered as Seto Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.83,0:04:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and he's using your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.13,0:04:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus must have taken my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The duelists are tied,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.99,0:04:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and the imposter has his second\Nblue-eyes white dragon on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.11,0:04:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi defeated the first\None using a combination
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.69,0:04:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,of the dark magician and magical hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.89,0:04:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He currently has 500 points\Nleft and no cards in play.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.85,0:04:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's his move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.41,0:04:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But without Exodia, Yugi can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.71,0:04:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He has no other cards left in his deck\Nthat can beat the Blue-Eyes White Dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.57,0:04:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,let alone two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.29,0:04:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, I hope you have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.53,0:05:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but we've got to work fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.69,0:05:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi will lose on the next attack\Nfrom the Blue-Eyes White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,unless we decrease its power from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.95,0:05:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.87,0:05:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.95,0:05:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Upload a virus into that\Nmonster's holocomputer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.73,0:05:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That dragon is about\Nto get sick. Real sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.01,0:05:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.11,0:05:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But shouldn't we first wait\Nto see Yugi's next move?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.07,0:05:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to risk\NYugi losing the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.37,0:05:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Upload.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Viral injection underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.41,0:05:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any monsters that can\Nwithstand his blue-eyes white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.49,0:05:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is over, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.83,0:05:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll be hearing the fat\Nlady sing right after your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.21,0:05:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have defense paralysis active,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.47,0:05:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,so whatever monster you pick\Nwon't be able to defend itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.27,0:05:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I choose the feral imp in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.67,0:05:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish Yugi waited a few\Nmore seconds before moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.17,0:06:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there anything you can do to get\Nthat computer virus uploaded faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.49,0:06:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're already halfway there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.13,0:06:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is as fast as it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Viral implant now at 60%, but\Nit doesn't seem to be working.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.25,0:06:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The Blue-Eyes White Dragon is\Nstill showing no signs of weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.05,0:06:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.47,0:06:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is almost too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.55,0:06:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.19,0:06:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi can still win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.49,0:06:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, he beat\NKaiba last time, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.03,0:06:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time, Blue-Eyes White Dragon! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.53,0:06:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.97,0:06:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.29,0:06:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The virus is taking effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.59,0:06:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-eyes-white dragon's attack\Npower is beginning to drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.29,0:06:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's still too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.07,0:06:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to get weaker, or\Nit'll still beat Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.01,0:06:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.27,0:06:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.87,0:07:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My blue-eyes-white dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.37,0:07:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Kimo to Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.55,0:07:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're watching, sir, because\Nwe got a real problem out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.11,0:07:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How did Yugi do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.75,0:07:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't Yugi, it was Seto Kaiba. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.49,0:07:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that the real Kaiba\Nis still very much alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.47,0:07:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The blue-eyes white dragon's\Nattack power is dropping rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The virus implant is successfully\Ndisabling the monster completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.93,0:07:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now let's get to\Nwork on dragon number three.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.23,0:07:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.87,0:07:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.09,0:07:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been locked out\Nby a remote terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.35,0:07:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we've been hacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.73,0:07:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.41,0:08:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kaiba. Move in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.93,0:08:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,On my mark. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.29,0:08:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack power is holding now at 2,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.85,0:08:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But this should've worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.57,0:08:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The Blue-Eyed White Dragon\Nis launching its attack. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.13,0:08:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Blue-Eyed White Dragon,\Ntime to obliterate them! Ha! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.51,0:08:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.41,0:08:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.27,0:08:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.97,0:08:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.05,0:08:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.95,0:08:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.11,0:09:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.15,0:09:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.59,0:09:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.27,0:09:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The blue-eyes white dragon is destroyed,\Nbut the virus was not responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.01,0:09:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.17,0:09:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Yugi Moto somehow do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.99,0:09:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.03,0:09:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It is your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.31,0:09:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.51,0:09:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.23,0:09:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.31,0:09:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.47,0:09:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.38,0:09:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Kaiba's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.83,0:09:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He stopped you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.03,0:09:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.94,0:09:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Kaiba! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.39,0:09:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your charade is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.43,0:09:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother is alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.45,0:09:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.71,0:09:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like Yugi said.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.39,0:09:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time Yugi dueled my brother, he\Nshowed Seto the heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.81,0:09:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This faker may have taken his death, but\Nthe real Seto Kaiba's alive and well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.73,0:10:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Imposter!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.57,0:10:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The real Seto Kaiba\Ndestroyed that monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.41,0:10:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I know because I sensed him\Ncalling out to me when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.37,0:10:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, enough of your lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.37,0:10:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We know you're not Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.91,0:10:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to show\Nus who you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.59,0:10:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, I am Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.35,0:10:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Or at least I'm part of\Nhim, the darkest part.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.93,0:10:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see you don't recognize me, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.77,0:10:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't lying when I\Ntold you I was Seto Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.15,0:10:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The evil part of him that you sent to\Nthe Shadow Realm after our last duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm back, thanks to Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.79,0:10:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not a part of my brother anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.69,0:10:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ew, it's hideous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.17,0:10:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I always thought that this duel just might\Nturn ugly, but I never thought that ugly
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.41,0:11:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, he got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.51,0:11:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Search the grounds, everywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.51,0:11:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, it appears that young Yugi's\Nnemesis, the real Seto Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.99,0:11:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,has come to his rescue I must\Nadmit that this little development
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.11,0:11:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,is one twist that even I did not\Nforesee I have some bad news, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.91,0:11:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The real Kaiba has eluded us once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.39,0:11:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.30,0:11:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He was using a terminal\Nin the Kaiba Mansion
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.45,0:11:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,to access the Industrial\NIllusion's mainframe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.23,0:11:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If I thought he was alive, I\Nwould have beefed up security.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.55,0:11:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's two escapes, Croquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.29,0:11:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Must I lock you away? Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.93,0:11:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me Kimo on the radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.81,0:11:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.77,0:11:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.75,0:11:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd start worrying about\Nwhat my big brother's
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.07,0:11:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna do to you when he\Nfinally catches up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.93,0:11:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, Takemo. Seto\NKaiba has gotten away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.41,0:11:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lose the little one no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.69,0:11:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.60,0:11:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I just don't\Nknow what to call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.99,0:11:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I was thinking about monster, but\NI didn't want to insult the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.99,0:12:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.37,0:12:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a whole deck to go through\Nand only one blue-eyes white dragon left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.15,0:12:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Grappler in defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.67,0:12:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just biding his time until\Nhe draws his last blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.07,0:12:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd play this card in defense mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.37,0:12:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's still got his defense paralysis\Ncard in play, so I can only attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.39,0:12:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And with no defense, if he draws the\Nblue eyes white dragon, I'm finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.77,0:12:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll set one card face down on the field\Nand draw the Celtic Guardian as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.79,0:12:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.83,0:12:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Your grappler split
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.93,0:12:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Parting is such sweet sorrow\NNext up is Mystic Horseman in
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.73,0:13:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Defense mode. And I'll lay one of\Nmy cards face down just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.93,0:13:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Face down?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a magic card or\Nis he setting a trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.69,0:13:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Again, I'll lay a card face down and I'll\Nuse the mystical elf in attack mode. Plus,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.65,0:13:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,this Book of Secret Arts will raise its\Nattack and defense power by 300 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.71,0:13:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.65,0:13:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Patience, Yugi, for it\Nwill soon be all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.05,0:13:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi has two cards face\Ndown and three monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.03,0:13:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be trying to\Nstrengthen the mystical elf
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.51,0:13:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,somehow to withstand my\Nmystic horseman's attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.29,0:13:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I draw the final blue eyes\Nand destroy any one of his monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.79,0:13:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,that will take his life\Npoints down to zero anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.17,0:13:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I find it hard to believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.17,0:13:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm liking the look on that guy's\Nface even less than I did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.03,0:14:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe that smile off his face, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.65,0:14:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Loser, make your move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.99,0:14:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.29,0:14:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll prepare for the\NBlue-Eyes White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.79,0:14:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.95,0:14:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.63,0:14:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother will help\Nout just like last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.01,0:14:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.92,0:14:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Your luck's about to run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.09,0:14:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just see for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike the last Blue-Eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.19,0:14:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,this one's at full power and your brother's\Nin no position to do a thing about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.87,0:14:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we found where his hiding\Nplace is and now he's on the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.85,0:14:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means Kaiba is alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Dimwit, it means don't\Nexpect another miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.89,0:14:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause this duel's about to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.65,0:14:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.11,0:14:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a good dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.11,0:14:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you say, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.01,0:15:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's about to end now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.19,0:15:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, white lightning attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.93,0:15:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.55,0:15:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate mirror force now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.09,0:15:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.15,0:15:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's turned over a trap card!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.95,0:15:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The mirror force reflects\Nyour attack right back at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.29,0:15:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty good trick, but I'm\Nready with one of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.77,0:15:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use negate attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.19,0:15:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we had a magic card\Nwaiting just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.61,0:15:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Negate attack neutralizes any attack\Nthrown at me, even if it's one of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.55,0:15:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to finish this duel\Nwith Reborn the Monster. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.55,0:15:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That allows you to revive any monster\Nlost in this duel from either deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.01,0:15:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you know the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.65,0:15:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now guess which card I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.61,0:16:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Be reborn, Blue Eyes, White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.11,0:16:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That lot of good that\Nmove's gonna do you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.25,0:16:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of these monsters are evenly matched.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.25,0:16:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Their powers are not the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.15,0:16:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You forgot about my mystical elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.69,0:16:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been chanting a spell\Nsince I put her on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.29,0:16:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It allows the mystical elf to transfer her
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.47,0:16:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,own attack power to any\Nother monster I choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.71,0:16:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.62,0:16:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.53,0:16:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This move was inspired\Nby Seto Kaiba himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.51,0:16:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He showed me that you can alter the\Nattack power of a blue-eyes white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.83,0:16:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm raising the power of mine instead\Nof lowering it like Kaiba did to yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.63,0:16:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening! Oh no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.83,0:16:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider this a message\Nfrom the real Seto Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.47,0:16:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.73,0:17:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, blue eyes, obliterate!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.51,0:17:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus may have helped you escape\Nthe Shadow Realm once before,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.99,0:17:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but it won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.83,0:17:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Never again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.75,0:17:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, I sense that you're watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.45,0:17:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider this a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.29,0:17:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing you send against me will stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.49,0:17:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And when we finally duel,\Nbelieve me, victory will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.47,0:17:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll win back my grandfather's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.69,0:17:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and you will pay for all the people you've
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.87,0:17:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,hurt in the name of your sick little game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.63,0:17:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.33,0:17:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you've developed your shadow\Npowers quite a bit in such a short time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.53,0:18:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But when we finally duel, believe me,\Nyour Millennium Puzzle will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.81,0:18:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.93,0:18:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That ghost is toast, huh, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.89,0:18:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I knew that the real Kaiba\Nwas alive the whole time. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.07,0:18:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.98,0:18:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.89,0:18:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That creep took Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.05,0:18:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.37,0:18:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it. Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.61,0:18:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone. Taken again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.99,0:18:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.33,0:18:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mokuba! Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.17,0:18:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.15,0:19:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
